# UI iconography

Canonical doc: [`docs/ICONOGRAPHY.md`](docs/ICONOGRAPHY.md).

## Size tokens (`static/css/brand.css`)

- `--icon-size-lg` (48px) — avatars / identity (`--avatar-display-size`)
- `--icon-size-md` (32px) — post actions, rail function glyphs
- `--icon-size-sm` (16px) — inline badges, compact thread/reply

Author action SVGs on 24×24 viewBox; scale with CSS, not raster.

## Council avatars as reference

Council portraits (`static/generated/council/`) use humanist editorial illustration, clear silhouettes, restrained texture, ≤64-colour palette. Function icons should echo that clarity at 16–32px (stroke-only, round joins, minimal interior detail).

## Hover

- **Function/system** icons (post actions, interactive rail controls, **feed chrome nav** `<<` `<` `>` `^`): hover/focus → `--ui-system-icon-hover` (yellow).
- **Links** and non-icon text actions: `--ui-action-hover` (blue).
- **CTAs** (`.btn-cta`): yellow text; not the same as icon hover.

## Feed chrome nav set

Paging (`<<`, `<`, `>`) and scroll-to-top (`^`) are one matched set — yellow chevron on dark disc (`.app-chrome-nav-btn`). Symbols: `icon-feed-first`, `icon-feed-prev`, `icon-feed-next`, `icon-feed-top` in `post-actions.svg`. See [`docs/ICONOGRAPHY.md`](docs/ICONOGRAPHY.md) § Feed chrome nav set.

## Do not

- Use yellow hover on identity avatars or semantic state colours (selected vote, feel heart).
- Introduce ad hoc icon pixel sizes outside the lg/md/sm ladder without updating `ICONOGRAPHY.md`.

When adding icons, update `static/icons/post-actions.svg` + `src/ui/post_icons.rs` and follow the redesign checklist in `docs/ICONOGRAPHY.md`.
